cmu-drone-platform-title = Choose drone platform
cmu-drone-platform-prompt = Choose one assembly package:
cmu-drone-platform-humanoid = Humanoid drone
cmu-drone-platform-humanoid-description = Android frame, limbs, activation key, tools, and modules.
cmu-drone-platform-tracked = Tracked combat drone
cmu-drone-platform-tracked-description = Tracked hull, pulse turret, standard/AP ammo, and repair supplies.
cmu-drone-platform-kit-examine = Use the kit to choose a humanoid or tracked drone. The kit is consumed after choosing.
cmu-drone-platform-unpacked = You unpack your chosen drone supplies into your bag or onto the ground beside you.
cmu-combat-drone-wreck-name = {$name} wreckage
cmu-combat-drone-wreck-examine = Its turret has collapsed into the scorched chassis. This wreck can be restored by welding the frame and replacing its burnt wiring.
cmu-combat-drone-wreck-restored = The drone's chassis powers back on as its systems recover.
cmu-combat-drone-ammo-slot = Ammunition box
cmu-combat-drone-outside-arc = The turret can only fire within the 180-degree arc in front of the chassis. Drive to turn the hull.
cmu-combat-drone-assembly-needs-turret = Install a pulse turret on the hull first.
cmu-combat-drone-assembly-needs-ammo = The turret is installed. Load a standard or AP ammunition box to activate the drone.
cmu-combat-drone-assembly-empty-ammo = The ammunition box is empty. Load a box with ammunition to activate the drone.
cmu-combat-drone-install-turret-start = You start securing the pulse turret to the tracked hull.
cmu-combat-drone-activate-start = You start loading the ammunition box and bringing the combat drone online.
cmu-combat-drone-frame-intact = Its frame is intact.
cmu-combat-drone-frame-dented = Its frame is dented and scored. A welder could repair it.
cmu-combat-drone-frame-buckled = Its frame is badly buckled and torn. It needs extensive welding.
cmu-combat-drone-wires-intact = Its wiring is intact.
cmu-combat-drone-wires-burnt = Burnt wires and damaged insulation show through its panels. Replace them with cable.
cmu-combat-drone-wires-charred = Its wiring is badly charred and corroded. Several cable bundles need replacing.
cmu-combat-drone-disabled = The drone is disabled. Repair its frame and wiring to bring it back online.
cmu-combat-drone-needs-wires = You need at least {$amount} lengths of cable to replace the damaged wiring.
cmu-combat-drone-wire-start = You start replacing the drone's burnt wiring.
cmu-combat-drone-wire-finish = You replace a damaged wiring bundle.
cmu-combat-drone-weld-finish = You weld the dents and fractures in the drone's frame.
